Substantial changes in this project relative to celve/claude-code-zed:
  - WebSocket authorization is enforced (upstream minted a token and never
    checked it, leaving the MCP session open to any local process)
  - JSON-RPC notifications are no longer answered with error responses
  - MCP protocolVersion restored to 2025-03-26
  - Lock file written atomically with 0600/0700 permissions
  - Selection text read from an in-memory document cache rather than from disk,
    so unsaved buffers report correctly
  - at_mentioned reachable via an authenticated local control route
